roke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"M376 365c0 10-8 18-18 18s-18-8-18-18 18-34 18-34 18 24 18 34Z\" fill=\"#80b7a5\"/>\n            <path d=\"M116 381h267\" stroke=\"#d6ddc9\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"336\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#e77c4d\"/>\n            <path d=\"M100 327v18M91 336h18\" stroke=\"#fffefa\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"M407 298c0-8 6-14 14-14s14 6 14 14v7h-28v-7Z\" fill=\"#d9e5b3\"/>\n            <path d=\"M411 305v24m10-24v24\" stroke=\"#244f46\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"M413 331h14\" stroke=\"#244f46\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n          <div class=\"art-card\">\n            <span class=\"art-card-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n            <span>Care in every detail<small>From first call to tidy-up</small></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"trust-bar\" aria-label=\"What you can expect\">\n      <div class=\"wrap trust-inner\">\n        <span class=\"trust-intro\">The North &amp; Hearth way</span>\n        <span class=\"trust-item\"><span class=\"trust-check\">\u2713</span> Friendly, familiar faces</span>\n        <span class=\"trust-item\"><span class=\"trust-check\">\u2713</span> Clear, honest communication</span>\n        <span class=\"trust-item\"><span class=\"trust-check\">\u2713</span> Respect for your home</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"services\" id=\"services\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"section-heading\">\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Here when home needs a hand</p>\n            <h2>Everyday plumbing, done thoughtfully.</h2>\n          </div>\n          <p>Whether it\u2019s a small repair or a bigger project, we\u2019ll help you find the right solution for your home.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"service-grid\">\n          <article class=\"service-card\">\n            <span class=\"service-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M7 4v5a5 5 0 0 0 10 0V4M5 4h4m6 0h4M12 14v3a3 3 0 0 0 6 0v-1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n                <path d=\"M18 19v1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n            <h3>Repairs &amp; leaks</h3>\n            <p>Dripping taps, leaking pipes and those little plumbing niggles that need sorting.</p>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"service-card\">\n            <span class=\"service-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M4 12h16v8H4zM7 12V8a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4M8 16h.01M12 16h.01M16 16h.01\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n            <h3>Bathrooms</h3>\n            <p>Careful plumbing support for bathroom updates, replacements and new installations.</p>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"service-card\">\n            <span class=\"service-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M5 20V9l7-5 7 5v11M9 20v-6h6v6M3 20h18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n                <path d=\"M12 8v3m-1.5-1.5h3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n            <h3>Heating &amp; radiators</h3>\n            <p>Help with radiator issues, heating pipework and plumbing around your system.</p>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"service-card\">\n            <span class=\"service-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M5 6h14v14H5zM8 3v6m8-6v6M8 13h3m2 0h3m-8 4h3m2 0h3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n            <h3>Kitchen plumbing</h3>\n            <p>Sink, tap and appliance connections, fitted with care and attention to the details.</p>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"service-card\">\n            <span class=\"service-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M12 3v18M5 8h14M7 8v5a5 5 0 0 0 10 0V8M9 4l3 4 3-4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n            <h3>Pipework &amp; taps</h3>\n            <p>New pipe runs, tap replacements and practical upgrades for everyday use.</p>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"service-card\">\n            <span class=\"service-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M12 3c-2.5 3.4-6 7.4-6 11a6 6 0 0 0 12 0c0-3.6-3.5-7.6-6-11Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n                <path d=\"M9 15c.4 1.2 1.4 2 2.7 2.2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n            <h3>General plumbing</h3>\n            <p>Not sure what the problem is? Tell us what\u2019s going on and we\u2019ll point you in the right direction.</p>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"story\" id=\"about\">\n      <div class=\"wrap story-grid\">\n        <div class=\"story-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 260\" fill=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M72 216h216\" stroke=\"#6e9384\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"m105 127 75-61 75 61v89H105v-89Z\" fill=\"#f7f5ef\"/>\n            <path d=\"m92 130 88-72 88 72\" stroke=\"#d9e5b3\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"M161 216v-50a19 19 0 0 1 38 0v50\" fill=\"#d9e5b3\"/>\n            <path d=\"M120 145h29v27h-29zM211 145h29v27h-29z\" fill=\"#d9e5b3\"/>\n            <path d=\"M135 145v27m91-27v27\" stroke=\"#fffefa\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"181\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#e77c4d\"/>\n            <path d=\"M79 217v-42h20v42M261 217v-42h20v42\" fill=\"#6e9384\"/>\n            <path d=\"M70 174h38m145 0h38\" stroke=\"#d9e5b3\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"M58 217h244\" stroke=\"#f7f5ef\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"82\" cy=\"78\" r=\"17\" fill=\"#e77c4d\"/>\n            <path d=\"M82 69v18m-9-9h18\" stroke=\"#fffefa\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"M274 73c0-8 6-14 14-14s14 6 14 14v7h-28v-7Z\" fill=\"#d9e5b3\"/>\n            <path d=\"M278 80v22m10-22v22\" stroke=\"#d9e5b3\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"M282 108c0 5-4 9-9 9s-9-4-9-9 9-17 9-17 9 12 9 17Z\" fill=\"#80b7a5\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">A bit about us</p>\n          <h2>A family business, built on looking after people.</h2>\n          <p class=\"story-copy\">We\u2019re a local family plumbing team who believe good work starts with listening. We take the time to understand what you need, explain your options clearly and treat your home with the care we\u2019d want for our own.</p>\n          <ul class=\"story-points\">\n            <li>Friendly, straightforward service</li>\n            <li>Careful, tidy workmanship</li>\n            <li>Advice without the jargon</li>\n            <li>Proud to serve Leeds homes</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"areas\" id=\"areas\">\n      <div class=\"wrap areas-inner\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Your neighbourhood plumbers</p>\n          <h2>Leeds is home.</h2>\n          <p>We work across Leeds and nearby communities. Give us a call to check whether we cover your area and to talk through the job.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"area-list\">Headingley \u00b7 Chapel Allerton \u00b7 Roundhay<br>Horsforth \u00b7 Meanwood \u00b7 Pudsey \u00b7 and beyond</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"contact\" id=\"contact\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"contact-panel\">\n          <div class=\"contact-content\">\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Let\u2019s get it sorted</p>\n            <h2>Need a hand with the plumbing?</h2>\n            <p>Call for a friendly chat about what\u2019s going on at home.</p>\n          </div>\n          <a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:+441132450187\">\n            Call 0113 245 0187\n            <svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer>\n    <div class=\"wrap footer-inner\">\n      <p>\u00a9 <span id=\"year\">2025</span> North &amp; Hearth Plumbing \u00b7 Leeds</p>\n      <div class=\"footer-l